data/quality/baselines/
# Orphaned atomic-write temps under the committed data plane (same class as
# site/go/**/.tmp_* above). Every writer here publishes through a unique temp in
# the target's own directory and unlinks it on failure, so one can only survive a
# hard kill mid-write — and the nightly's `git add data/` would then commit it
# forever. The real artifacts never end in .tmp.
data/**/*.tmp
